/K [4]
>>
endobj
278 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 137 0 R
/E (Current commercial architectures rely on unscalable, expensive item-level hardware tracking \(RFID\) which is financially unviable for standard retail integration. The capital expenditure required for full RFID deployment across a typical grocery store's SKU range renders these solutions inaccessible to the majority of retail operators.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
